name normalcolor
category Package
revision 40125
shortdesc Changing \normalcolor
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides a command \setnormalcolor with the same
longdesc syntax as the command \color either of package color or of
longdesc package xcolor. However, \setnormalcolor will not change the
longdesc current colour but the normal / default color.
